  Information available:

  Abstract   ADD        DELETE     EXIT       HELP       INVOKE     MODIFY     Operation  QUIT       SET        VIEW

Topic? DELETE

DELETE

     This command allows you to delete one or more lines from the FDL
     file. If the line is the only remaining secondary attribute in a
     primary section, the primary attribute is also removed. After you
     remove a line, you can optionally continue to delete lines under
     the affected primary section.

     Format

       DELETE
   



  Additional information available:

  Example

DELETE Subtopic? KEY 1

